{"title":"Career Roadmap — Exhibition Designer","role":"Exhibition Designer","summary":"An Exhibition Designer designs physical environments where people interact with information, products, objects, brands, artworks, or experiences.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Data Visualisation / Information Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Exhibition Designer designs physical environments where people interact with information, products, objects, brands, artworks, or experiences."},{"type":"h","text":"They work on spaces such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Art galleries"},{"text":"Trade shows"},{"text":"Corporate exhibitions"},{"text":"Brand experience centres"},{"text":"Cultural exhibitions"},{"text":"Science exhibitions"},{"text":"Educational exhibitions"},{"text":"Temporary event installations"},{"text":"Visitor centres"},{"text":"Pop-up experiences"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines spatial design, storytelling, architecture, graphic communication, visitor experience, lighting, materials and technology."},{"type":"p","text":"An Exhibition Designer is not simply designing attractive displays. The objective is to create a space that communicates a clear narrative or experience while considering visitor movement, accessibility, safety, budget and construction."}]},{"heading":"What an Exhibition Designer Does","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understanding the exhibition brief"},{"text":"Researching the subject and audience"},{"text":"Developing the exhibition concept"},{"text":"Creating spatial layouts"},{"text":"Designing visitor circulation"},{"text":"Developing storytelling strategies"},{"text":"Designing display systems"},{"text":"Integrating graphics and signage"},{"text":"Selecting materials and finishes"},{"text":"Coordinating lighting and AV"},{"text":"Creating 3D models and visualisations"},{"text":"Preparing technical drawings"},{"text":"Working with fabricators and contractors"},{"text":"Coordinating installation"},{"text":"Conducting site inspections"},{"text":"Evaluating visitor experience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer works closely with curators, architects, graphic designers, fabricators, engineers, lighting designers, content teams and clients."}]},{"heading":"Exhibition Designer vs Related Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"text":"Exhibition spaces and visitor experience"}],[{"text":"Spatial Designer"},{"text":"Physical environments and experiences"}],[{"text":"Interior Designer"},{"text":"Interior environments and functionality"}],[{"text":"Retail Designer"},{"text":"Commercial retail environments"}],[{"text":"Set Designer"},{"text":"Film, television and performance environments"}],[{"text":"Museum Designer"},{"text":"Museum interpretation and exhibitions"}],[{"text":"Experience Designer"},{"text":"Immersive physical/digital experiences"}],[{"text":"Event Designer"},{"text":"Temporary event environments"}],[{"text":"Architect"},{"text":"Buildings and larger built environments"}],[{"text":"Graphic Designer"},{"text":"Visual communication"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"These roles overlap, but the Exhibition Designer is particularly focused on content + space + visitor journey."}]},{"heading":"Core Skills Required","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Exhibition Designer needs four major skill groups:"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Zoning"},{"text":"Display systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Environmental graphics"},{"text":"Signage"},{"text":"Wayfinding"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Construction drawings"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Fabrication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visitor psychology"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Audio-visual integration"},{"text":"Immersive technology"}]}]},{"heading":"Exhibition Design Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A typical project follows:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brief"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Content / Story"},{"type":"h","text":"Concept Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Journey"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Fabrication"},{"type":"h","text":"Installation"},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Testing"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"The process may be iterative rather than strictly linear."}]},{"heading":"Exhibition Storytelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important skills is converting information into a spatial narrative."},{"type":"p","text":"For example, a science exhibition might follow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Introduction"},{"type":"h","text":"The Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Discovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Experiments"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Impact"},{"type":"h","text":"Future Possibilities"},{"type":"h","text":"The visitor should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Where to go"},{"text":"What to look at"},{"text":"What to read"},{"text":"What to interact with"},{"text":"What the key message is"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is why storytelling and spatial planning are equally important."}]},{"heading":"Visitor Journey Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Exhibition Designer should think about the experience from the visitor's perspective."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"h","text":"Entrance"},{"type":"h","text":"Orientation"},{"type":"h","text":"First Attraction"},{"type":"h","text":"Main Story"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Deep-Dive Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Reflection"},{"type":"h","text":"Exit / Call to Action"},{"type":"h","text":"Important considerations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entry visibility"},{"text":"Congestion"},{"text":"Dwell time"},{"text":"Viewing distances"},{"text":"Seating"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Rest areas"},{"text":"Emergency exits"},{"text":"Visitor flow"}]}]},{"heading":"Spatial Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Students should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Zoning"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Human scale"},{"text":"Sightlines"},{"text":"Spatial hierarchy"},{"text":"Display heights"},{"text":"Visitor capacity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic zoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Entrance"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Orientation"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Main Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Interactive Zone"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Information Zone"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Rest Area"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Exit"},{"type":"p","text":"The design should prevent bottlenecks and confusing circulation."}]},{"heading":"Environmental Graphics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Exhibitions depend heavily on visual communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Signage"},{"text":"Wayfinding"},{"text":"Environmental graphics"},{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"Maps"},{"text":"Digital displays"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The graphic system should work together with the physical space rather than appearing as unrelated posters placed on walls."}]},{"heading":"Materials & Fabrication","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Exhibition Designer needs practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wood"},{"text":"MDF"},{"text":"Plywood"},{"text":"Metal"},{"text":"Acrylic"},{"text":"Glass"},{"text":"Fabric"},{"text":"Foam"},{"text":"Vinyl"},{"text":"Printed graphics"},{"text":"Modular systems"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structural limitations"},{"text":"Finishes"},{"text":"Durability"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Assembly"},{"text":"Dismantling"},{"text":"Reuse"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Temporary exhibitions particularly require attention to modular construction and efficient installation."}]},{"heading":"Digital Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"2D"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"InDesign"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3D"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SketchUp"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"3ds Max"},{"text":"Blender"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"Lumion"},{"text":"Twinmotion"},{"text":"D5 Render"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Presentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Adobe InDesign"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students do not need every software package. A practical combination could be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AutoCAD","SketchUp/Rhino","Adobe Creative Cloud","one rendering tool"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Technical Drawing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Students should be able to produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Detail drawings"},{"text":"Display-unit drawings"},{"text":"Joinery details"},{"text":"Material specifications"},{"text":"Lighting layouts"},{"text":"Signage layouts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Technical drawings help convert the design concept into something a fabricator can actually build."}]},{"heading":"Lighting Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Lighting strongly influences exhibitions."},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ambient lighting"},{"text":"Accent lighting"},{"text":"Task lighting"},{"text":"Display lighting"},{"text":"Colour temperature"},{"text":"Glare"},{"text":"Shadows"},{"text":"Light levels"},{"text":"Dramatic lighting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum"},{"type":"p","text":"Controlled lighting may be required to protect sensitive objects."},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Exhibition"},{"type":"p","text":"Lighting may be used to create a dramatic experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Exhibition"},{"type":"p","text":"Lighting can guide visitors through different zones."}]},{"heading":"Interactive & Immersive Exhibitions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern exhibitions increasingly incorporate technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Touchscreens"},{"text":"Projection mapping"},{"text":"Interactive walls"},{"text":"Motion sensors"},{"text":"AR"},{"text":"VR"},{"text":"Mixed reality"},{"text":"Spatial audio"},{"text":"LED displays"},{"text":"Interactive installations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The technology should solve an experience or communication problem rather than being added simply because it looks impressive."}]},{"heading":"AI in Exhibition Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept exploration"},{"text":"Spatial ideation"},{"text":"Moodboards"},{"text":"Visual references"},{"text":"Content summarisation"},{"text":"Visitor persona generation"},{"text":"Experience scenarios"},{"text":"Interactive concept development"},{"text":"Exhibition content organisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"A practical workflow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Brief"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted Concept Exploration"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Design Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Planning"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Model"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"Fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-generated visual concepts still need validation against:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Structural requirements"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Fire and safety requirements"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Fabrication constraints"}]}]},{"heading":"Sustainability","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Exhibition design can generate substantial temporary construction waste."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Modular construction"},{"text":"Reusable exhibition systems"},{"text":"Recyclable materials"},{"text":"Low-waste fabrication"},{"text":"Rental components"},{"text":"Flat-pack structures"},{"text":"Reusable graphics"},{"text":"Energy-efficient lighting"},{"text":"Responsible material sourcing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable exhibition principle"},{"type":"p","text":"Design the exhibition for its entire lifecycle, not just opening day."},{"type":"h","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"h","text":"Transportation"},{"type":"h","text":"Installation"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Dismantling"},{"type":"h","text":"Reuse / Recycling / Storage"}]},{"heading":"B.Des Academic Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Drawing"},{"text":"Visual communication"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"Basic model making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Begin spatial exercises:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Small installations"},{"text":"Display units"},{"text":"Basic exhibition layouts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong spatial observation and visual communication."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Spatial & Exhibition Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Human scale"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Exhibition graphics"},{"text":"Display systems"},{"text":"Material exploration"},{"text":"Model making"},{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"3D modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museum display"},{"text":"Retail display"},{"text":"Small gallery"},{"text":"Product exhibition"},{"text":"Interactive installation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Professional Exhibition Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Large-scale exhibition planning"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Visitor experience"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"AV integration"},{"text":"Fabrication"},{"text":"Construction documentation"},{"text":"Budget awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Work with multidisciplinary teams:"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Graphic Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Architect / Spatial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Content / Curatorial Team"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Fabricator"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Lighting / AV Team"}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Major Exhibition Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final project should be large enough to demonstrate professional capability."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible projects:"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"History of Indian Science"},{"type":"h","text":"Science Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Future of Artificial Intelligence"},{"type":"h","text":"Cultural Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Indian Textile Heritage"},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainability Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Circular Economy and Climate"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Future Mobility Experience Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Exhibition"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Body / Space / Ocean Exploration"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Structure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional portfolio should show the entire design process."},{"type":"h","text":"Brief"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Content Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Concept"},{"type":"h","text":"Storyline"},{"type":"h","text":"Spatial Zoning"},{"type":"h","text":"Visitor Journey"},{"type":"h","text":"Floor Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"3D Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Graphics"},{"type":"h","text":"Lighting"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Drawings"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Include"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept sketches"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Moodboards"},{"text":"Floor plans"},{"text":"Sections"},{"text":"Elevations"},{"text":"3D models"},{"text":"Physical models"},{"text":"Material boards"},{"text":"Graphics"},{"text":"Wayfinding"},{"text":"Lighting concepts"},{"text":"Renderings"},{"text":"Technical drawings"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Project","Skills Demonstrated"],"rows":[[{"text":"Museum Exhibition"},{"text":"Curatorial + spatial design"}],[{"text":"Science Exhibition"},{"text":"Information design"}],[{"text":"Trade Show Booth"},{"text":"Commercial exhibition"}],[{"text":"Brand Experience"},{"text":"Experiential design"}],[{"text":"Cultural Exhibition"},{"text":"Storytelling"}],[{"text":"Interactive Exhibition"},{"text":"Technology"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Exhibition"},{"text":"Sustainable construction"}],[{"text":"Pop-up Exhibition"},{"text":"Temporary structures"}],[{"text":"Retail Experience"},{"text":"Commercial spatial design"}],[{"text":"Immersive Installation"},{"text":"Experience design"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain both conceptual and technically resolved projects."}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Suitable internships include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition Design Intern"},{"text":"Spatial Design Intern"},{"text":"Museum Design Intern"},{"text":"Retail Design Intern"},{"text":"Experience Design Intern"},{"text":"Interior Design Intern"},{"text":"Event Design Intern"},{"text":"Environmental Graphic Design Intern"},{"text":"Exhibition Production Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition design studios"},{"text":"Museum consultancies"},{"text":"Architecture firms"},{"text":"Retail design firms"},{"text":"Event agencies"},{"text":"Brand experience agencies"},{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Trade-show companies"},{"text":"Experiential marketing companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Production-oriented internships are particularly valuable because they teach students how exhibitions are actually fabricated and installed."}]},{"heading":"Career Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Museum Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artefacts"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Educational experiences"},{"text":"Visitor journeys"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Trade Show Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Booths"},{"text":"Brand communication"},{"text":"Product displays"},{"text":"Visitor engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Brand Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Immersive brand environments"},{"text":"Product launches"},{"text":"Experiential marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Retail Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stores"},{"text":"Customer journeys"},{"text":"Visual merchandising"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Cultural Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heritage"},{"text":"Art"},{"text":"History"},{"text":"Cultural storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Immersive Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Projection"},{"text":"Interactive media"},{"text":"AR/VR"},{"text":"Spatial storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Exhibition Production Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fabrication"},{"text":"Installation"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Technical execution"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate programmes can include:"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Des"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition Design"},{"text":"Spatial Design"},{"text":"Interior Design"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Experience Design"},{"text":"Strategic Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Master's"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Exhibition Studies"},{"text":"Interior Architecture"},{"text":"Spatial Design"},{"text":"Experience Design"},{"text":"Environmental Design"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For museum-focused careers, museum studies or exhibition-focused postgraduate education can complement a B.Des background."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Typical pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Design Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative route:"},{"type":"h","text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Experience Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Experience Design Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Director"}]},{"heading":"Related Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A graduate can also pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition Designer"},{"text":"Spatial Designer"},{"text":"Experience Designer"},{"text":"Museum Designer"},{"text":"Retail Designer"},{"text":"Set Designer"},{"text":"Event Designer"},{"text":"Environmental Graphic Designer"},{"text":"Visual Merchandiser"},{"text":"Interior Designer"},{"text":"Brand Experience Designer"},{"text":"Installation Designer"},{"text":"Exhibition Producer"},{"text":"Design Consultant"}]}]},{"heading":"Skill-Gap Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Beginner","Job Ready","Advanced"],"rows":[[{"text":"Spatial Planning"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Exhibition Storytelling"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Expert"}],[{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"3D Modelling"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Model Making"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Graphics"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Fabrication"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Visitor Experience"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Strong"},{"text":"Expert"}],[{"text":"Project Coordination"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"}]]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Spatial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Space planning"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Zoning"},{"text":"Display design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Environmental graphics"},{"text":"Wayfinding"},{"text":"Information design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"SketchUp/Rhino"},{"text":"3D rendering"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"Model making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Visitor psychology"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Immersive technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client presentations"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Budget awareness"},{"text":"Site coordination"}]}]},{"heading":"Placement & Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Students should be prepared to explain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you design a museum exhibition?"},{"text":"How would you control visitor movement?"},{"text":"How do you decide the placement of exhibits?"},{"text":"How would you design an exhibition for children?"},{"text":"How would you make an exhibition accessible?"},{"text":"How would you reduce construction waste?"},{"text":"How would you integrate digital technology?"},{"text":"How would you work with a limited budget?"},{"text":"How would you coordinate with a fabricator?"},{"text":"How would you turn a curator's content into a spatial narrative?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should be able to demonstrate design reasoning rather than only visual presentation skills."}]},{"heading":"What Students Should Avoid","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"❌ Designing only attractive 3D renders"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional exhibition work requires technical resolution."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring visitor flow"},{"type":"p","text":"A visually impressive exhibition can fail if visitors do not know where to go."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring content"},{"type":"p","text":"Exhibition design exists to communicate information or create an experience."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring accessibility"},{"type":"h","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wheelchair movement"},{"text":"Viewing heights"},{"text":"Readability"},{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Tactile experiences"},{"text":"Neurodiversity"},{"text":"Clear navigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Ignoring fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"Designs must be buildable within real constraints."},{"type":"h","text":"❌ Using technology without purpose"},{"type":"p","text":"AR, VR and projection should improve communication or experience rather than simply add spectacle."}]},{"heading":"Ideal 4-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Expected Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design + visual foundation"},{"text":"Models + small installations"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Spatial + exhibition design"},{"text":"3–4 exhibition projects"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Technical + professional practice"},{"text":"Large exhibition + internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Specialisation + portfolio"},{"text":"4–6 professional case studies"}]]}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an ideal candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Des in Exhibition / Retail / Spatial Design"},{"text":"Strong spatial-design fundamentals"},{"text":"Exhibition storytelling skills"},{"text":"Visitor journey planning"},{"text":"Space planning and circulation"},{"text":"Environmental graphics knowledge"},{"text":"Wayfinding knowledge"},{"text":"CAD proficiency"},{"text":"3D modelling proficiency"},{"text":"Rendering skills"},{"text":"Physical model-making experience"},{"text":"Materials and fabrication knowledge"},{"text":"Basic lighting and AV knowledge"},{"text":"Accessibility awareness"},{"text":"Sustainable exhibition-design knowledge"},{"text":"1–2 internships or equivalent industry experience"},{"text":"4–6 strong exhibition/spatial case studies"},{"text":"At least one museum/cultural project"},{"text":"At least one commercial/brand exhibition"},{"text":"At least one interactive or immersive project"},{"text":"At least one sustainable exhibition project"},{"text":"Technical drawings and construction details"},{"text":"Professional portfolio and presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Spatial/Exhibition Design","Spatial Planning","Visitor Experience","Storytelling","AutoCAD","3D Modelling","Environmental Graphics","Fabrication Knowledge","Sustainable Design","Interactive Technology","4–6 Strong Exhibition Projects","Industry Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This profile gives the graduate access not only to Exhibition Designer roles but also to adjacent careers in spatial design, museum design, retail design, experience design, brand experience, environmental graphics and immersive installations."}]}]}